/* Developer tools, client side. A game adds this list to its client progs.src
   (after src/client/include.src and src/shared/include.src); leaving it out drops
   the tools, and the SDK falls back to the stubs in src/client/tools.qc. */
#includelist
client/vgui_modelspawner.qc
client/Editor.qc
client/EditorSun.qc
client/way.qc
client/commands.qc
#endlist
